OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe odd shower is possible over
OL,6,Fwestern Tayside at first, but
OL,7,Fotherwise it will be a dry day with
OL,8,Fvariable cloud and sunny spells, best
OL,9,Fof the sunshine in the east. Light
OL,10,Fwinds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FIt will be a dry and settled
OL,13,Fnight with light winds. Mostly cloudy
OL,14,Fskies, though some clear intervals are
OL,15,Fpossible. Chilly in places.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
