OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA dry and mostly cloudy
OL,6,Fmorning with some brightness at times.
OL,7,FCloud lowering and becoming thicker in
OL,8,Fthe afternoon with some light rain
OL,9,Fpossible. Winds strengthening through
OL,10,Fthe day.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FCloudy
OL,13,FWednesday with strong winds and heavy
OL,14,Frain spreading east, dry and clear
OL,15,Flater. Dry with sunny spells Thursday
OL,16,Fand winds easing. Dry start with sunny
OL,17,Fspells Friday, rain later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
